Tags
    Tags are predefined words enclosed with angular braces/brackets <>

Types of Tags
   1.Paired Tag.
   2.Unpaired Tag.

Paired Tags
   Paired Tag having both opening tag & closing tag.
         <tagname></tagname>
  eg: <html></html> , <h></h> , <title></title>

Unpaired Tags
  This tag having only opening tag ,there is no closing tag.
  eg: <meta> , <br> ,<hr> , <input>

