Element
   Element is combination of tag & content.
    <tagname> content </tagname>

Types
  1.Inline Level Element.
  2.Block Level Element.
  3.Inline Block Level Element.

Inline Level Element
   This Element will be displayed in the Same Line.
   It will take or occupy the content area.
   We can't provide the height & width in the element.
   eg: <b></b>, <i></i>, <u></u>

Block Line Element
   There element take the full width of the parent element.
   It will display in different lines.
   Here we can create height & width.
   eg: heading tags(h1-h6) , <p></p> tag.

Inline Block Level Element
   It is a combination of inline and block level element.
   It will display in same line but we can provide height and width.
   eg: <button></button> , <input></input>

